  "label": "The woman is mapped as the entity who can help with getting into the U.S.",
  "description": "The text 'who needs help getting into the u.s i can help' explicitly maps the visual entity (the Black woman) as the person who facilitates entry into the U.S., implying she is involved in or complicit with illegal immigration. This mapping is created by the juxtaposition of the text with the image of the woman in a formal setting, suggesting she is the 'helper' referenced in the text.",
